config CIX_SQUASHFS
	tristate "CIX experimental SquashFS reader"
	depends on BLOCK
	depends on SQUASHFS
	select SQUASHFS_XATTR
	help
	  Build the separately named cix_squashfs reader.  It accepts only the
	  private CIX compressor id 65001 and never extends the stock squashfs
	  filesystem.  This is experimental and not an upstream format claim.
